 in a custom error handler?\r\n\r\nCustom error handler","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/issues/comments/662277242/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"lu-zen","id":11050840,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDUwODQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11050840?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen","html_url":"https://github.com/lu-zen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/issues/comments/662286198","html_url":"https://github.com/fastify/fastify/issues/2430#issuecomment-662286198","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/issues/2430","id":662286198,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY2MjI4NjE5OA==","user":{"login":"Eomm","id":11404065,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDA0MDY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11404065?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eomm","html_url":"https://github.com/Eomm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eomm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eomm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eomm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eomm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eomm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eomm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eomm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eomm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eomm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-07-22T07:14:58Z","updated_at":"2020-07-22T07:14:58Z","body":"You can write:\r\n\r\n```\r\n  validatorCompiler: ({ schema, method, url, httpPart }) => {\r\n    return function (data) {\r\n      try {\r\n        const result = schema.validateSync(data, yupOptions)\r\n        return { value: result }\r\n      } catch (e) {\r\n        e.validationContext = httpPart\r\n        return { error: e }\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n```\r\n\r\nWe should think if we could improve this code as you pointed out:\r\n\r\n```\r\n function wrapValidationError (result, dataVar) { \r\n   if (result instanceof Error) { \r\n     return result \r\n   } \r\n```\r\n\r\nThe logic was to don't change the original `Error` here\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/issues/comments/662286198/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Eomm","id":11404065,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDA0MDY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11404065?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eomm","html_url":"https://github.com/Eomm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eomm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eomm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eomm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eomm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eomm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eomm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eomm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eomm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eomm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/issues/comments/662296079","html_url":"https://github.com/fastify/fastify/issues/2430#issuecomment-662296079","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/issues/2430","id":662296079,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY2MjI5NjA3OQ==","user":{"login":"lu-zen","id":11050840,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDUwODQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11050840?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen","html_url":"https://github.com/lu-zen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-07-22T07:38:17Z","updated_at":"2020-07-22T07:38:17Z","body":"Thanks, it works. I think it's good to add the context field into 3rd party Error objects, it's the intended behavior no?\r\n\r\n> To help you in writing a custom `errorHandler`, Fastify adds 2 properties to all validation errors:\r\n\r\n> * validation: the content of the `error` property of the object returned by the validation function (returned by your custom `schemaCompiler`)\r\n> * validationContext: the 'context' (body, params, query, headers) where the validation error occurred\r\n\r\nOr even remove this responsibility from the framework ([formatting custom messages as well](https://github.com/fastify/fastify/blob/a2a3726d7f932fa3a03f92900561ddd0d2a9b19f/lib/validation.js#L122)) and let user add the context manually to catch the error/format the message.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/issues/comments/662296079/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"lu-zen","id":11050840,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDUwODQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11050840?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen","html_url":"https://github.com/lu-zen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu-zen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/issues/comments/670814545","html_url":"https://github.com/fastify/fastify/issues/2430#issuecomment-670814545","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fastify/fastify/issues/2430","id":670814545,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY3MDgxNDU0NQ==","user":{"login":"stale[bot]","id":26384082,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90MjYzODQwODI=","avatar_url":